"The Azure Hills were once the Azure Mountains, a rich province, before a demonic attack."
"Long ago a demonic formation and explosion, the Breaking, shattered the province's Dragon Veins."
"The Dragon Veins are old underground channels of Qi tied to the province's spirit."
"The ancient disaster addled survivors' minds and souls, driving most of them mad."
"The Azure Hills' weak Qi is not natural; it is a slow, still-healing wound from the Breaking."
"Someone at Fa Ram is repairing the shattered Dragon Veins; a latticework grows near the surface."
